          "sid": "hotels-t1-s01",
          "c": "我訂咗一間房。",
          "j": "ngo5 deng6 zo2 jat1 gaan1 fong2.",
          "e": "I booked a room.",
          "note": "訂 (deng6) means \"to book / reserve\" — 訂房 (deng6 fong2) \"book a room\", 訂枱 (deng6 toi2) \"book a table\". The 咗 (zo2) marks it done: 訂咗 (deng6 zo2) \"have booked\". 間 (gaan1) is the room's classifier.",
