          "note": "鎖匙 (so2 si4) is the Cantonese for \"key\" (Mandarin 鑰匙). 鎖匙俾我 (so2 si4 bei2 ngo5) \"give me the key\" — fronting the thing (鎖匙) is natural for emphasis.",
