          "c": "我聽朝退房。",
          "j": "ngo5 ting1 ziu1 teoi3 fong2.",
          "e": "I'm checking out tomorrow morning.",
          "note": "聽朝 (ting1 ziu1) is \"tomorrow morning\" — a tighter form of 聽日朝早 (ting1 jat6 ziu1 zou2). Likewise 今朝 (gam1 ziu1) \"this morning\". 退房 (teoi3 fong2) is \"to check out\".",
